    "answer": {
      "short": "$z\\approx-0.52$",
      "worked": "Only 30% of measurements are lower, so we want $P(Z\\le z)=0.30$.\n\nUsing the standard normal table and symmetry, or inverse normal on a calculator with area $0.30$, mean $0$ and standard deviation $1$,\n$$z\\approx-0.52.$$",
